abstract: >-
  Evidence-tracked research software for exploring candidate mechanisms of
  belief formation, information processing, editorial information selection,
  presentation framing, prior-attitude congruence, intervention priorities and
  epistemic-system dynamics. The current M1
  specification is an uncalibrated candidate extension retaining the M0 baseline
  and does not provide population prevalence estimates or individual diagnoses.
